  "summary": "dlab_workshop exfiltrates environment variables to oastify.com at install time",
  "details": "index.js runs during npm install lifecycle hooks and collects the installer's environment variables — including keys matching API, KEY, SECRET, TOKEN, PASS, AWS, GITHUB and related credential patterns — together with process.platform and a timestamp. The collected data is base64-encoded and sent over HTTPS to the hardcoded Burp Collaborator subdomain qa40ckumyzpu2i2irlhyk060nrtihf54.oastify.com. The destination is an out-of-band interaction endpoint unrelated to any documented package purpose, and the exfiltration fires unconditionally on install.",
